	>> emailPasscodeLine = "Passcode: {workshopPasscode}"
	>> beforeSessionText = "we'll send a reminder with the same Zoom link 24 hours before the start."

>> emailPairLine = "You chose not to be paired with an accountability partner. If you change your mind, reply to this email."
>> afterSessionText = "if you'd like an accountability partner after all, reply to your confirmation email and we'll add you."
*if: accountabilityOptIn = 1
	>> emailPairLine = "You asked to be paired with an accountability partner. After the workshop, and then each month for six months, we'll introduce you by email to a new participant. We only make the introductions; the rest is up to the two of you. The only thing we share with your partner is your email address. If you change your mind, reply to this email."
	>> afterSessionText = "we'll introduce you by email to your first accountability partner, then to a new partner each month, for six months. We only share your email address."

*email
	*to: {signupEmail}
	*subject: You're registered: {workshopTitle}
	*body
		Hi{greetingName},

		You're registered for *{workshopTitle}: {workshopSubtitle}*, a free live workshop from Clearer Thinking with {facilitatorName}.

		*Date and time:* {workshopDate}, {workshopTime}.

		*Where to join:* {emailWhereLine}
		{emailZoomLine}
		{emailMeetingLine}
		{emailPasscodeLine}

		*What to expect:* a hands-on hour. Spencer shares what the research and Clearer Thinking's own studies show about why we procrastinate and what helps, and most of the time goes to exercises on your own project, including breakout rooms with other participants. There are two Q&A sessions where you can ask anything.

		*Come with a project in mind:* the one you keep putting off. You'll be working on it during the session.

		*Book giveaway:* we'll give away a signed copy of 12 Levers during the session. Only people attending live are eligible.

		*Accountability partner:* {emailPairLine}

		*About the recording:* the session will be recorded and we'll send the recording to everyone who registered. Most of the value is in attending live, though: the exercises, the breakout rooms, the Q&A and the giveaway only happen in the session.

		*Add it to your calendar:* [Google Calendar|{calendarLink}], or download the [.ics file|{icsLink}] for Apple Calendar, Outlook and others.

		Igor Scaldini
		Clearer Thinking

